# The Rising | INT | Print Workshop, Burning | NIGHT | okiku, old_tsuta | Save the blocks | A beam down, fire in the paper store. She drags him out. He will not let go of the blocks. Her mother's house is the next street | | 6 | vfx=fire, stunts=building collapse, props=woodblocks
# The Windfall | EXT | Ruined Ward, Timber Yard | DAY | shinza, okiku, the_catfish | Rebuild | The creature breathing beyond the roofs. Carpenters at triple wages. A storehouse splits and coin spills. {shinza} buys everyone a drink | Disaster makes the poor rich | 6 | crowd=200, vfx=giant catfish, props=timber+coins
# The Windfall | INT | Print Workshop, Lean-To | NIGHT | okiku, old_tsuta | Cut the first print | One night, one block: the fish, the mob, the rich man vomiting gold. No seal, no name. By noon there is a queue | The prints spread | 6 | props=woodblocks+prints
# The Windfall | EXT | Street Stall | DAY | okiku, inspector_goto | Be searched | An official with a satchel. Who published this? Nobody. He confiscates twenty and folds one into his sleeve | | 5 | crowd=60, props=prints
# The Return | EXT | Riverside, Dawn | DAWN | okiku, shinza, the_catfish | Hold it down | A figure with a great stone walks up the river. Ropes, townspeople, a long groan. The flank sinks. The river lies down | The god pins the catfish | 8 | water, crowd=300, vfx=giant catfish+god with stone, stunts=rope teams
# The Return | EXT | Magistrate's Yard | DAY | inspector_goto, old_tsuta, okiku | Burn the blocks | A heap of carved wood, alight. {old_tsuta} weeps for the pear wood. {okiku} has one sheet inside her sleeve, and pastes it in a cupboard | | 4 | vfx=bonfire, props=woodblocks+print
review: authored | 2026-11-12 | written whole; drawn from the catfish prints made after the Edo earthquake of 1855, with invented people
